  "description": "Meet the Eskute V100 16\" Mini Electric Bike — compact size, serious performance.\nWith chunky 16\"x4.0\" one-piece wheels, full suspension with a front fork + rear shock, and a powerful 500W–1500W motor delivering speeds up to 28 MPH, the V100 is built for responsive performance across a variety of riding conditions.\n\nPowered by a 48V 13Ah battery (upgradeable to 52V), paired with a 7-speed shifter, twist throttle, and versatile electric / pedal-assist / manual modes, the V100 gives riders flexible control for different riding needs.\n\nComplete with an NFC display, front & rear fenders, long saddle, and optional rear rack, the V100 combines comfort, control, and distinctive moped-inspired styling.\n\nBuilt for riders who want powerful performance, versatile handling, and more freedom to explore.",
